OL,3,GNEWSAProposal for space testing centre
OL,4,Aset for decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford could be home to a space
OL,7,Ftesting facility if a #9m scheme is
OL,8,Fagreed by the council.
OL,10,FThe Space Test North centre could
OL,11,Fcreate 50 jobs and establish Keighley
OL,12,Fas "a nationally important hub for
OL,13,Fspace technology", according to the
OL,14,Fproposal.
OL,16,FBradford Council will decide whether to
OL,17,Fapprove a grant of up to #4.5m from the
OL,18,FLocal Regeneration Fund towards the
OL,19,Foverall cost of developing the new site
OL,20,Fat Providence Park.
