OL,3,GNEWSAProposal for space testing centre
OL,4,Aset for decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpace Test North would provide
OL,7,Fspecialist radio frequency and
OL,8,Fenvironmental testing for space and
OL,9,Fsatellite hardware, according to the
OL,10,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
